  "blocks": [
    {
      "tag": "h2",
      "text": "WELCOME TO MARINA HARBOR DETOX"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Compassionate, accredited medical detox and residential rehab provided by experienced clinicians with over 15 years of addiction treatment expertise in a private, luxury setting designed for lasting recovery."
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "San Francisco Medical Detox & Rehab"
    },
    {
      "tag": "h2",
      "text": "Safe, Private Addiction Treatment in The Bay Area"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Marina Harbor is San Francisco’s premier addiction treatment center, offering specialized medical detox and residential programs, located on Marina Boulevard in San Francisco. As the critical first steps in the journey toward sobriety, our programs ensure that withdrawal is managed safely and comfortably. We utilize advanced clinical protocols to assist individuals struggling with addictions to alcohol, opiates, benzodiazepines, cocaine, methamphetamines, heroin, fentanyl, and more. We also provide an integrated dual diagnosis approach that stabilizes the body while addressing underlying mental health challenges. Our intimate, 6-bed setting offers the privacy and professional care necessary to build a resilient foundation for long-term sobriety."
    },
    {
      "tag": "h2",
      "text": "Certified for Clinical Excellence"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Marina Harbor Detox proudly maintains accreditation and licensure from leading healthcare and regulatory organizations."
    },
    {
      "tag": "h2",
      "text": "Certified for Clinical Excellence"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Marina Harbor Detox proudly maintains accreditation and licensure from leading healthcare and regulatory organizations."
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Expert clinical support through every stage of your journey"
    },
    {
      "tag": "h2",
      "text": "Comprehensive Addiction Treatment Programs in San Francisco"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "At Marina Harbor Detox, we provide a seamless transition from initial stabilization to long-term wellness. Our San Francisco facility offers a full spectrum of evidence-based services designed to address the physical, emotional, and psychological components of addiction within a private, boutique environment."
    },
    {
      "tag": "h3",
      "text": "Medical Detox"
    },
    {
      "tag": "h3",
      "text": "Aftercare & Alumni Care"
    },
    {
      "tag": "h2",
      "text": "Speak With a Recovery Advocate Today"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "If you or a loved one are ready to take the first step, our compassionate admissions team is available 24/7 to answer your questions and verify your insurance."
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Addiction Treatment Programs That Cares About the Outcome"
    },
    {
      "tag": "h2",
      "text": "Evidence-Based Therapies & Luxury Amenities For Your Recovery"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "At Marina Harbor Detox, we believe that true recovery requires a balance of intensive clinical work and a supportive, comfortable environment. Our San Francisco facility is designed to reduce the stressors of early sobriety, allowing you to focus entirely on your physical and emotional well-being."
    },
    {
      "tag": "h3",
      "text": "Evidence-Based & Holistic Therapies"
    },
    {
