      "text": "Secure & Confidential Gated Campus"
    },
    {
      "tag": "h2",
      "text": "Hear From Our Patients"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "24/7 medical monitoring during withdrawal"
    },
    {
      "tag": "h2",
      "text": "Start Recovery with Safe Medical Detox"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "For many individuals, recovery begins with medical detox, where the body safely clears drugs or alcohol under medical supervision. Our clinical team monitors withdrawal symptoms and provides medications when appropriate to ensure safety and comfort. After detox, clients can continue treatment through residential care and therapy programs."
    },
    {
      "tag": "h2",
      "text": "Tour Our San Francisco Facility"
    },
    {
      "tag": "h2",
      "text": "We Work With Most Insurances"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "We believe that financial barriers should never stand in the way of life-saving treatment. We work with a vast network of providers and are experienced in maximizing benefits for residential treatment and medical detox services."
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "A sanctuary for recovery in northern california"
    },
    {
      "tag": "h2",
      "text": "Serving San Francisco, the Bay Area, and Beyond"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Located in San Francisco’s iconic Marina District, Marina Harbor Detox provides a sophisticated, 6-beds boutique setting where healing begins with peace and privacy. We offer a premier destination for those seeking a higher standard of clinical care away from the noise of daily life. We provide specialized withdrawal management and residential support for individuals and families in:"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "For those traveling from outside the Bay Area or out of state, we offer a full-concierge experience. Our team coordinates every detail of your arrival, including private, secure transport from SFO, OAK, and SJC airports directly to our doors, ensuring your journey into care is safe, discreet, and stress-free."
    }
  ],
